# The phone number reaches ONLY the built PDF and never the repository (design
# doc §10). `out/` is gitignored, and so is `.env` itself; only this example is
# tracked.
#
#   cp .env.example .env   # then fill in the number
#   pnpm pdf               # or: CV_PHONE="+380…" pnpm pdf
#
# With the variable unset, the phone block simply is not rendered into the PDF and
# the build stays green.
CV_PHONE=
